  "description": "Jade’s seemingly hopeless wish for her runaway brother to return takes a twist when she falls into another reality. This new fantastical world has everything the maladaptive daydreamer could ever wish for; magic, adventure, romance, and even signs of her lost brother. However, Jade soon finds this place isn’t the utopia she’s always wished for. Everyone here harbors dark pasts they’re all trying to run away from... including Jade herself.\nSource: Lezhin",
